# Environment files and local secret stores
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template
!**/.env.defaults
!**/.env.*.example
!**/.env.*.sample
!**/.env.*.template
**/.envrc
**/.direnv/
**/.secrets/
**/secrets.local/
**/secrets.local.*
**/*.secrets.local.*

# Credentials and service-account material
**/.npmrc.local
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.dockercfg
**/.git-credentials
**/credentials.local.json
**/*-credentials.local.json
**/service-account*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/.aws/credentials
**/.ssh/

# Private keys, certificates, signing stores, and deployment credentials
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.mobileprovision
**/*.tfvars
